er</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roaming the battlefield with a spicy hot sauce gun  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">ranged dealer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711080/extras/93c59168f2affee2c1bf21c20ef8e3d6.avif?t=1787273241\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>wizard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An area-of-effect damage dealer sweeping through enemies while holding a whisk wand  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711080/extras/653dc6e20f785eb89b2e250ba5ba94ae.avif?t=1787273241\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>warrior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Holding a skewer rapier and quickly swinging it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Melee dealer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711080/extras/51e429c8007e35d937dd07bd3dfa4169.avif?t=1787273241\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>repairman</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A reliable tank that repairs and defends buildings with a pork cutlet hammer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src